  "description": "Mesh UV unwrapper for the Prowl Game Engine. Produces lightmap-style atlases from arbitrary triangle meshes and packs the charts into [0,1]². Two methods: a box-projection unwrapper (default) that charts by dominant normal direction for near-uniform texel density in ~1.5s on Sponza (260k tris), and a conformal one using Lloyd-style chart segmentation, angle-based flattening (LinABF) and least-squares conformal mapping (LSCM) for tighter atlases at ~10x the cost. Parallel, SIMD-vectorised CG solver.",
